&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Senior Software Engineer II&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Team: Engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Prolific&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Prolific is not just another player in the AI space – we are the architects of the human data infrastructure that&#39;s reshaping the landscape of AI development. In a world where foundational AI technologies are increasingly commoditized, it&#39;s the quality and diversity of human-generated data that truly differentiates products and models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The role&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;548&quot;&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer II, you will play a pivotal role in driving technical excellence across one of our product development teams. You will lead the technical direction of projects, ensuring the delivery of scalable, secure, and high-quality solutions, while providing guidance, mentorship, and support to engineers across the team. The role may also include line management responsibilities for less experienced team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you’ll bring to the role&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Technical Projects&lt;/strong&gt;: Oversee the design and implementation of key projects, delivering innovative solutions that align with business goals and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with Stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;: Work closely with Product Managers and other stakeholders to define project scope, timelines, and resources, providing expert technical guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Engineering Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;: Create high-quality, efficient code, uphold coding standards through code reviews and contribute to strategic initiatives and standards through the Technical Authority Group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor and Develop Team Members&lt;/strong&gt;: Foster a collaborative and inclusive team environment, mentoring others and assisting in hiring and onboarding new talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence Technical Direction&lt;/strong&gt;: Play a key role in strategic technical decisions, promoting the adoption of new technologies and processes to enhance product functionality and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
